	(text "VEML3328 U6  |  Fixed I2C address 0x10 (7-bit)\nSDA GPIO22 / SCL GPIO23; R9/R20 = 4.7k to 3V3; initial 100 kHz.\nC19: VDD pin4. Supply current: 580 uA typical / 1 mA maximum.\nRead red, green, blue, clear and IR. Configure integration time before use." (at 18 20 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b014c4b-846f-5289-8aea-ee7483307250"))
)
